{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quick reflexes. Simple controls. Instant retries!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon Strike is a fast-paced action-puzzler where you dash, bounce, and swap colors for survival. Get the color right, you're safe. Get it wrong... instant retry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/24feee1c4f37da69559f0c12570a9a04.poster.avif?t=1759680610\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/24feee1c4f37da69559f0c12570a9a04.webm?t=1759680610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/24feee1c4f37da69559f0c12570a9a04.mp4?t=1759680610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls are super simple: one button to move, one to switch colors. Play with one hand on keyboard, mouse, or controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start as a sphere with one color and can absorb more by colliding with other spheres. But you can only store two colors at a time. Grab a third, and the oldest one gets replaced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To pass anything that isn\u2019t a sphere, your active color must match. Get it wrong and you\u2019ll explode. Watch out for other traps too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There\u2019s more than one way to play:</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to the goal! Bounce, stick, and aim your way through grid-based puzzles using smart angles and color swaps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/b0309bb60b8424c44f8114ec0d85ab51.poster.avif?t=1759680610\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/b0309bb60b8424c44f8114ec0d85ab51.webm?t=1759680610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/b0309bb60b8424c44f8114ec0d85ab51.mp4?t=1759680610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Infinite Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive as long as you can. Things only get faster, meaner, and more chaotic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/535dc31e58fac5a49048b1b8267b3d55.poster.avif?t=1759680610\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/535dc31e58fac5a49048b1b8267b3d55.webm?t=1759680610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/535dc31e58fac5a49048b1b8267b3d55.mp4?t=1759680610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're in for a quick session or a challenge, Neon Strike keeps it simple, vibrant, and fun to retry.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3685030?t=1759680610","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/4f92bbee557576e222715f2d8902b82d5dda5d1b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759680610","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/5ef5afb23f0b2f43b67c8d951f5d9b6dac7e14cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759680610","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/5ef5afb23f0b2f43b67c8d951f5d9b6dac7e14cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759680610","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quick reflexes. Simple controls. Instant retries!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon Strike is a fast-paced action-puzzler where you dash, bounce, and swap colors for survival. Get the color right, you're safe. Get it wrong... instant retry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/24feee1c4f37da69559f0c12570a9a04.poster.avif?t=1759680610\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/24feee1c4f37da69559f0c12570a9a04.webm?t=1759680610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/24feee1c4f37da69559f0c12570a9a04.mp4?t=1759680610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls are super simple: one button to move, one to switch colors. Play with one hand on keyboard, mouse, or controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start as a sphere with one color and can absorb more by colliding with other spheres. But you can only store two colors at a time. Grab a third, and the oldest one gets replaced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To pass anything that isn\u2019t a sphere, your active color must match. Get it wrong and you\u2019ll explode. Watch out for other traps too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There\u2019s more than one way to play:</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to the goal! Bounce, stick, and aim your way through grid-based puzzles using smart angles and color swaps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/b0309bb60b8424c44f8114ec0d85ab51.poster.avif?t=1759680610\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/b0309bb60b8424c44f8114ec0d85ab51.webm?t=1759680610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/b0309bb60b8424c44f8114ec0d85ab51.mp4?t=1759680610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Infinite Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive as long as you can. Things only get faster, meaner, and more chaotic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/535dc31e58fac5a49048b1b8267b3d55.poster.avif?t=1759680610\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/535dc31e58fac5a49048b1b8267b3d55.webm?t=1759680610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/535dc31e58fac5a49048b1b8267b3d55.mp4?t=1759680610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're in for a quick session or a challenge, Neon Strike keeps it simple, vibrant, and fun to retry.</p>","developers":["Reza Mirzaei"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","